{
  "_comment": [
    "P1's gamepad is on the arrow keys, with B on Z, A on X, Y on A, X on S, L on Q, R on W, Select on Tab and Start on Return, and on the first game controller; P2's is on the second game controller. On a controller each button is the one in the same place: the bottom face button is B, the right one A, the left one Y and the top one X, the shoulders L and R, Back is Select and Start is Start, and the directional pad and the left stick are the arrows (chimera#334). The mouse follows the host's mouse: its movement and its left and right buttons. Power ships unbound. A key of the Uzebox keyboard is on the host's key of the same name, except the keys the gamepad uses (the arrows, Z, X, A, S, Q, W, Tab and Return), which ship unbound."
  ],
